<title>LATVIA: TWO YIELDS DOWN, ONE UP AT T-BILL AUCTION.</title>
<headline>TWO YIELDS DOWN, ONE UP AT T-BILL AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yields on one and three</p>
<p>month maturities fell and six-month paper was up at an auction</p>
<p>for Latvian Treasury bills fell on Wednesday, the finance</p>
<p>ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD	 LAST  NO OF BANKS    ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> One-month    3.14	  3.36	 6	    0.5   1.32 0.5</p>
<p> Three-month  3.48	  3.72	 5	    0.7   1.58 0.7</p>
<p> Six-month    4.37	  4.14	 7	    2.0   4.14 2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
